Name: Android Install Referrer Library
Short Name: installreferrer
URL: https://developer.android.com/google/play/installreferrer
Version: 2.2
License: Android Software Development Kit License
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
CPEPrefix: unknown

Description:
The Install Referrer Library provides a reliable way to retrieve referrer information from Google Play Store.
This is used by the Branch SDK for install attribution and campaign tracking.